  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp; Lil' Baby Cakes has been in business since 1999 offering our unique style of baby gift centered around the gift of diapers.&nbsp; Our customers and clients purchase our product as an alternative to traditional baby gifts such as clothing, flowers, or gift baskets.&nbsp; Each Lil' Baby Cake is artfully designed and hand assembled completely in-house to create a boutique gift experience new family's love.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description:&nbsp; Our designs are all handmade using Pampers Swaddlers diapers arranged to mimic a traditional tiered cake.&nbsp; Each design features a popular baby theme or color scheme to match a broad selection of interests.&nbsp; Most designs include a popular branded plush animal that becomes a keepsake for the newborn long after the diapers are gone.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp; Lil' Baby Cakes creates a baby gift alternative centered around the baby's need for diapers.&nbsp; This creates a baby gift that's not only unique but practical as all new families need diapers for the care of their newborn.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp; All credit cards along withe PayPal accepted.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information:&nbsp; Shipping limited to the lower 48 contiguous states.</p>\r\n</div>",
